          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "\"Mr. Lamar, do you really know how to play the game? Then tighten up.\"\n\"Tightening up\" is a concept pushed onto Black communities--here telling the rapper to change the performance to fit the white agenda and level of comfort"
            }
