        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "\"The old culture cheat code.\nScorekeeper, deduct one life.\"\nNod to the importance of tight-knit community, and the punishment of Black Americans and creation of a culture that purposefully puts Black communities in harms way"
            }
